{"page":232,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:89","surah":11,"ayah":89,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَـٰقَوْمِ لَا يَجْرِمَنَّكُمْ شِقَاقِىٓ أَن يُصِيبَكُم مِّثْلُ مَآ أَصَابَ قَوْمَ نُوحٍ أَوْ قَوْمَ هُودٍ أَوْ قَوْمَ صَـٰلِحٍ ۚ وَمَا قَوْمُ لُوطٍ مِّنكُم بِبَعِيدٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"My people, do not let your opposition to me bring upon you a similar fate to the peoples of Noah or Hud or Salih; the people of Lot are not far away from you.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَـٰقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"And O my people","transliteration":"wayāqawmi","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Let) not cause you to sin","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَجْرِمَنَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"(Let) not cause you to sin","transliteration":"yajrimannakum","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":4,"ar":"شِقَاقِىٓ","en_gloss":"my dissension","transliteration":"shiqāqī","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"lest","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُصِيبَكُم","en_gloss":"befalls you","transliteration":"yuṣībakum","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّثْلُ","en_gloss":"similar","transliteration":"mith'lu","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"(to) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَصَابَ","en_gloss":"befell","transliteration":"aṣāba","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(the) people of Nuh","transliteration":"qawma","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نُوحٍ","en_gloss":"(the) people of Nuh","transliteration":"nūḥin","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(the) people of Hud","transliteration":"qawma","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هُودٍ","en_gloss":"(the) people of Hud","transliteration":"hūdin","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"11:89"},{"pos":16,"ar":"قَوْمَ","en_gloss":"people of Salih","transliteration":"qaw